---
title: Peanut Butter Cups
author: Mary Arntson
category: Candy
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@peanut butter (creamy){1%cup}
@butter{0.25%lb}
@powdered sugar{2%cups}
@chocolate almond bark
@small candy papers

Mix peanut butter, butter, and powdered sugar together thoroughly and make small balls. Flatten with the palm of your hand. Melt chocolate almond bark. Using small candy papers, put a small amount of chocolate in the bottom, put in the flattened candy dough and then cover with melted chocolate. Refrigerate.
